<title>USA: Arkansas may sell up to $30 mln of college bonds.</title>
<headline>Arkansas may sell up to $30 mln of college bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Arkansas Development Finance Authority plans to issue up to $30 million of Arkansas college savings bonds some time in April, an authority spokesman said.</p>
<p>The sale's underwriting team has yet to be finalized, Derrick Rose, the authority's communications director, said.</p>
<p>As for other deals, &quot;there's some tentative things, but nothing we are ready to go public with,&quot; Rose said.</p>
<p>--Kathie O'Donnell, 212-859-1655</p>
